OrangeIslands_Sunburst_House1_Text_Quarryman::
	.string "I cut stone on the first floor.\n"
	.string "Never below it.\p"
	.string "The hikers who work the second\n"
	.string "floor earn more than me and I do\l"
	.string "not envy them one coin.$"

OrangeIslands_Sunburst_House1_Text_Daughter::
	.string "I put my ear on the floor of the\n"
	.string "cave and I heard it.\p"
	.string "It was not digging. It was\n"
	.string "breathing.$"

